WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:28.610 --> 01:30.780
Good morning!

01:30.780 --> 01:33.280
What's with the early wake-up call?

01:38.260 --> 01:39.460
It looks tasty!

01:39.460 --> 01:40.830
Amazing, isn't it?

01:40.830 --> 01:42.790
Houx and I prepared it all.

01:43.160 --> 01:45.560
All Saule did was set the table.

01:45.560 --> 01:47.070
Don't tell them that, Houx!

01:47.070 --> 01:49.230
Ah, Houx-sama!

01:49.230 --> 01:52.040
Sure he's handsome,
but it's so cool that he can cook, too.

01:52.040 --> 01:53.640
Well then, Waffle-sama..

01:53.640 --> 01:58.210
I've been saving this special magic
so you can make a Love-Love Arrow.

01:58.210 --> 01:59.590
A Love-Love Arrow?

02:01.210 --> 02:02.750
If this arrow flies true,

02:02.750 --> 02:05.750
Houx-sama will eventually
fall madly in love with me.

02:05.750 --> 02:06.390
Arrows away!

02:28.640 --> 02:29.960
Waffle-sama!

02:32.240 --> 02:34.150
Help me!

02:39.950 --> 02:42.220
Save me, Nana!

02:42.220 --> 02:43.760
Waffle-sama...

02:43.760 --> 02:45.740
grab my cane!

02:54.100 --> 02:55.500
What was that noise just now?

02:55.500 --> 02:57.330
Something's going down over there.

02:58.370 --> 02:59.440
What's alLthis?

02:59.440 --> 03:01.330
Did someone use magic?

03:01.330 --> 03:03.680
I know! It's got to be...

03:03.680 --> 03:05.640
another one of
Blanca's lame schemes!

03:05.640 --> 03:06.710
How rude!

03:06.710 --> 03:09.580
I would never make
something that tacky!

03:09.580 --> 03:11.950
Gotta be one of Robin's pranks.

03:11.950 --> 03:13.480
Wouldn't surprise me.

03:15.650 --> 03:17.820
Waffle becomes a Queen.

03:19.560 --> 03:22.090
That was super scary!

03:22.090 --> 03:25.100
It's all the love-love arrow's
fault for not flying straight.

03:25.630 --> 03:27.930
The blame is mine to bear.

03:27.930 --> 03:30.970
If only I'd made the bow
just a bit smaller...

03:30.970 --> 03:33.970
For you are still a child, Waffle-sama.

03:34.510 --> 03:35.610
A child?

03:35.610 --> 03:37.540
I'm not a kid anymore!

03:38.710 --> 03:41.910
I'm mature enough to be
a match for Houx-sama!

03:42.880 --> 03:45.050
Don't cry, Waffle-sama.

03:45.050 --> 03:46.420
Please don't cry.

03:46.420 --> 03:47.490
Look at this!

03:47.490 --> 03:50.720
It is a sweet and scrumptious candy.

03:50.720 --> 03:51.860
Yay!

03:53.490 --> 03:54.890
It's so sweet!

03:54.890 --> 03:56.660
But not good enough!

03:56.660 --> 03:58.340
I just told you,
I'm not a kid anymore!

04:00.970 --> 04:03.340
That's right, because
you treat me this way...

04:03.340 --> 04:06.240
Houx-sama won't see me as a lady!

04:06.240 --> 04:07.710
Waffle-sama...

04:07.710 --> 04:09.470
And besides, all of your plans...

04:09.470 --> 04:11.390
have failed, Nana!

04:11.390 --> 04:13.550
But that, that is...

04:13.550 --> 04:16.280
If I want something done I'll have to do it myself!

04:16.280 --> 04:18.450
You're fired, Nana!

04:18.450 --> 04:20.150
F-Fired!?

04:23.680 --> 04:26.660
Ah, Waffle-sama!

04:34.000 --> 04:36.000
I'm a grown woman!

04:36.000 --> 04:37.700
From now on, I'll use my own power...

04:37.700 --> 04:39.500
to make Houx-sama love me.

04:41.340 --> 04:44.070
First off, Plan #1!

04:51.420 --> 04:53.180
Nothing comes to mind.

04:55.750 --> 04:59.490
Come to think of it, I can only use a little of magic right now.

04:59.490 --> 05:00.520
What should I do?

05:02.260 --> 05:05.460
I'll never live it down...
if I have to apologize to Nana.

05:06.900 --> 05:07.930
What a drag...

05:07.930 --> 05:11.470
Making so many deliveries this early in the morning feels really hectic.

05:11.470 --> 05:13.940
Mister Magic World
Mail Order Man!

05:14.640 --> 05:15.570
What is it?

05:16.230 --> 05:17.810
Pretty please!

05:17.810 --> 05:19.840
I want your most powerful
love merchandise!

05:19.840 --> 05:22.510
I have 17,600 ecure right here.

05:22.510 --> 05:23.280
NO WAY!

05:23.280 --> 05:25.050
Incredible!

05:25.050 --> 05:27.420
As if I'd really say that.

05:28.650 --> 05:29.690
Little girl,

05:29.690 --> 05:32.390
we're not playing house here,
so you can't use toy hearts.

05:33.660 --> 05:35.090
Good day to you.

05:35.090 --> 05:36.080
Hold it right there!

05:37.160 --> 05:39.300
How can you be so rude to a lady?

05:39.300 --> 05:41.200
You've got so much stuff there.

05:41.200 --> 05:42.670
Can't I please have just one?

05:43.500 --> 05:45.270
What's with this girl?

05:45.270 --> 05:46.890
C'mon, I said "please"!

05:47.170 --> 05:48.910
You're barking up the wrong tree.

05:48.910 --> 05:50.010
Tightwad!

05:50.010 --> 05:50.990
I'm not a tightwad!

05:50.990 --> 05:52.910
This is why you don't get the ladies!

05:56.040 --> 05:57.750
Wait a second!

05:58.250 --> 06:00.190
Sorry, but I don't feel
like dealing with you.

06:00.190 --> 06:00.770
Bye!

06:03.150 --> 06:03.720
Bii!

06:09.830 --> 06:12.260
All right! Got it!

06:14.810 --> 06:16.800
Whoa, it's a tiara.

06:17.600 --> 06:19.400
So pretty...

06:19.400 --> 06:19.840
Here.

06:20.470 --> 06:22.970
Let's see... now where's the manual?

06:23.540 --> 06:25.650
"If you wear this Queen's Tiara..."

06:26.010 --> 06:27.110
"any man you desire..."

06:27.110 --> 06:28.950
"will be entranced by you."

06:28.950 --> 06:30.320
Amazing!

06:30.320 --> 06:32.780
I can use this to make Houx-sama
return my feelings!

06:35.350 --> 06:36.290
I'm outta here!

06:36.290 --> 06:37.860
I've got day duty.

06:37.860 --> 06:38.560
They're so fast.

06:38.560 --> 06:41.090
Chocolat-chan,
we've got to hurry too.

06:41.090 --> 06:41.930
Yeah.

06:49.330 --> 06:49.830
Huh?

06:49.830 --> 06:51.590
Waffle's gone missing?

06:52.100 --> 06:57.280
I was only separated trom her for a little
while, and now it's come to this.

06:57.280 --> 07:03.380
Waffle-sama is so honest, pure, naive,
dependent, and delicate...

07:03.380 --> 07:06.750
When I imagine what's running
through her head right now,

07:06.750 --> 07:09.290
I get so very worried...

07:09.290 --> 07:13.160
No, that girl's sly and crafty
enough that she'll be fine.

07:13.160 --> 07:14.590
Chocolat-chan...

07:16.800 --> 07:19.360
Waffle-sama, where could you be?

07:19.360 --> 07:20.060
Um...

07:20.060 --> 07:21.800
I'm thinking she's probably at school.

07:22.670 --> 07:23.670
Of course!

07:23.670 --> 07:25.370
For Waffle, Houx is her life.

07:25.370 --> 07:26.960
So she'll go where he goes.

07:30.480 --> 07:31.840
'Morning.

07:31.840 --> 07:34.180
Good morning.

07:34.880 --> 07:37.380
Ahh, he'll finally return my love!

07:37.380 --> 07:39.680
Just thinking about it makes
my heart beat faster!

07:39.680 --> 07:41.720
Houx-sama, show up already!

07:42.190 --> 07:44.090
Oh, before I use it on Houx-sama.

07:44.090 --> 07:45.860
I should test it out.

07:45.860 --> 07:51.060
I tell you, that new mid-air
Motoyama Chop is out of this world!

08:01.110 --> 08:02.540
Your Majesty...

08:02.540 --> 08:04.410
I am your servant.

08:04.410 --> 08:06.710
If it be for your sake,
we will do anything!

08:07.780 --> 08:10.680
Wow, it really does work!

08:25.860 --> 08:27.290
Your Majesty...

08:27.600 --> 08:31.140
Wow! This is so amazing
it even works on girls!

08:31.140 --> 08:32.270
Hey, Bii...

08:32.270 --> 08:36.950
I became queen before
Chocolat or Vanilla!

08:36.950 --> 08:39.660
Indeed, I am the Queen.

08:40.850 --> 08:42.180
Indeed...

08:43.750 --> 08:45.370
Hurry it up! I'm going
to be late for day duty.

08:45.370 --> 08:46.680
Houx-sama!

08:48.990 --> 08:51.720
Your Majesty...

08:51.720 --> 08:52.790
Your Majesty...

08:52.790 --> 08:54.060
Your Majesty...

08:54.840 --> 08:57.630
What's going on?

08:57.630 --> 09:04.240
Your Majesty...

09:04.240 --> 09:07.240
Somebody help me,
I'm being squished!

09:12.280 --> 09:14.380
I'll cover the Middle School.

09:14.380 --> 09:15.250
Okay.

09:15.250 --> 09:16.010
See you later.

09:16.010 --> 09:18.250
If we don't hustle, we're
gonna be late, Vanilla!

09:18.250 --> 09:18.750
Okay.

09:21.250 --> 09:22.850
Just in the nick of time!

09:23.660 --> 09:24.540
What's wrong?

09:24.890 --> 09:27.360
We are your servants.

09:27.360 --> 09:30.290
If it be for your sake,
we will do anything!

09:30.600 --> 09:32.430
Do anything...

09:34.300 --> 09:35.430
Did you see that?

09:35.430 --> 09:36.670
I saw it.

09:36.670 --> 09:38.500
What are they doing?

09:38.500 --> 09:40.800
Man, I'm sooo late!

09:46.140 --> 09:47.680
Your Majesty...

09:51.150 --> 09:52.950
What's going on?

09:52.950 --> 09:54.590
They've all been brainwashed.

09:55.490 --> 09:56.350
Aha!

09:56.350 --> 09:58.490
You're an alien, aren't you?

09:58.490 --> 10:01.020
You want to brainwash humanity
and then invade the Earth!

10:03.760 --> 10:11.790
Your Majesty...

10:16.570 --> 10:17.880
Waffle?

10:17.880 --> 10:18.880
Why are they...?

10:18.880 --> 10:20.480
Settle down!

10:20.480 --> 10:21.580
It's so noisy in here.

10:22.250 --> 10:23.640
What are you doing here?

10:25.950 --> 10:33.390
Your Majesty...

10:33.390 --> 10:35.360
What the heck is going on?

10:46.000 --> 10:52.140
Your Majesty...

10:55.310 --> 10:57.080
It is super-effective,

10:57.080 --> 10:59.680
but being this popular is hard work.

11:01.450 --> 11:05.960
Please listen to this song of
praise we wrote for you...

11:06.460 --> 11:09.090
Oh Queen of ours,

11:09.090 --> 11:12.460
you shine upon us...

11:12.460 --> 11:15.300
like the sun from on high.

11:15.300 --> 11:18.700
Gorgeous and lovely,

11:18.700 --> 11:21.540
you will ever be our Queen!

11:24.580 --> 11:26.680
Your Majesty is incredible!

11:26.680 --> 11:29.280
Words cannot describe
your regal visage!

11:29.280 --> 11:30.650
Please watch us.

11:30.650 --> 11:33.650
We will be dancing for you, Your Majesty.

11:33.650 --> 11:35.150
Your Ma - je - sty...

11:35.650 --> 11:37.460
Your Ma - je - sty...

11:37.460 --> 11:39.420
L-O-V-E...

11:39.420 --> 11:41.130
Your Ma- je- sty...

11:41.790 --> 11:43.330
Check it out, Chocolat-chan.

11:43.330 --> 11:44.700
Your Majesty...

11:49.730 --> 11:51.270
Blue hearts?

11:51.270 --> 11:53.270
What were they, again?

11:53.710 --> 11:55.510
Hearts of respect.

11:55.510 --> 11:57.540
I believe they're worth
3,000 ecure apiece.

11:58.080 --> 11:59.440
3,000 ECURE?

11:59.440 --> 12:01.710
Then in total they'd be
worth tens of thousands...

12:01.710 --> 12:03.660
no, hundreds of thousands of ecure!

12:03.950 --> 12:07.420
But Waffle's still too
young to take hearts.

12:08.290 --> 12:11.890
If Blanca heard about this, she'd throw
a fit about it being "such a waste."

12:13.160 --> 12:15.930
All the macaroons fell into the lake!

12:16.690 --> 12:19.960
It's such a waste that
it drives me to tears.

12:19.960 --> 12:21.880
What on Earth is she dreaming about?

12:22.270 --> 12:24.840
Your Majesty...

12:25.240 --> 12:27.610
Yeah, I know.
I acknowledge you all.

12:27.610 --> 12:30.740
But I need to hurry up
and meet Houx-sama.

12:30.740 --> 12:31.840
Bye-bye!

12:33.480 --> 12:34.610
Your Majesty...

12:34.610 --> 12:39.280
Your Majesty...

12:40.280 --> 12:42.450
Not this again...!

12:46.660 --> 12:49.360
Anyway, it looks like that
tiara's causing this.

12:49.360 --> 12:52.860
Hey, maybe it's a Queen's Tiara from the Magical World Mail Order Catalogue.

12:52.860 --> 12:54.330
A Queen's Tiara?

12:54.330 --> 12:58.790
Yeah. It's a tiara that entrances boys
with the light of its jewels.

12:59.100 --> 13:02.570
I was really torn on whether
I should buy it or not.

13:03.010 --> 13:06.380
But that thing Waffle has doesn't
just work on boys.

13:06.380 --> 13:08.180
It works on girls too.

13:08.180 --> 13:11.780
And if they're in any kind of trance,
it's the religious kind.

13:11.780 --> 13:12.580
Yeah.

13:12.580 --> 13:14.320
Because it's defective.

13:15.310 --> 13:18.790
I never thought it'd be here, but
I finally tracked it down.

13:18.790 --> 13:20.860
What do you mean it's "defective"?

13:20.860 --> 13:23.590
The buyer complained that
its powers were too strong.

13:23.590 --> 13:28.370
She wanted to return it,
so I went and picked it up.

13:28.370 --> 13:31.040
But then I got careless and
dropped it on the way back.

13:31.040 --> 13:34.100
It wound up in that kid's hands,
and now she's using it.

13:35.040 --> 13:37.080
Waffle-sama!!

13:37.480 --> 13:39.140
Houx! Saule!

13:39.140 --> 13:41.300
We heard there was something
major going on here.

13:41.680 --> 13:44.780
Bii came and told us that
Waffle was in trouble.

13:45.510 --> 13:47.990
Waffle's not really "in trouble."

13:47.990 --> 13:49.950
Once she takes off the tiara,

13:49.950 --> 13:52.120
everything will go back to normal.

13:52.120 --> 13:54.460
Ah, that makes sense!

13:54.460 --> 13:57.500
But is Waffle willing to take it off?

13:57.500 --> 13:59.630
Yeah, shell be hard to convince.

14:02.770 --> 14:03.990
Houx-sama!

14:06.600 --> 14:07.910
Your Majesty!

14:07.910 --> 14:09.240
Houx-sama...

14:09.240 --> 14:11.410
You mustn't look at the tiara!

14:11.410 --> 14:14.050
The light from the jewels
will cast a spell.

14:14.050 --> 14:14.750
Yeah.

14:14.750 --> 14:15.710
Oh shi-

14:15.710 --> 14:19.170
But does that mean Houx-sama
will finally return Waffle-sama's love?

14:19.170 --> 14:20.280
Your Majesty.

14:21.290 --> 14:23.620
Houx-sama is gazing at me.

14:23.620 --> 14:24.590
Wonderful!

14:25.860 --> 14:28.360
This is the moment
I've been waiting for.

14:28.890 --> 14:32.060
The day Houx-sama returns my love!

14:32.060 --> 14:33.930
It's super-romantic!

14:37.170 --> 14:39.020
Your Majesty...

14:39.020 --> 14:41.970
Will you take me away from
here, Houx-sama?

14:41.970 --> 14:42.940
As you wish.

14:48.680 --> 14:53.780
Your Majesty...

14:53.780 --> 14:56.090
I can't allow you all to do this!

14:57.290 --> 14:58.720
Oh, that reminds me–

14:59.720 --> 15:01.560
Bow to me!

15:01.560 --> 15:03.920
Your Majesty...

15:04.460 --> 15:05.500
Very good.

15:05.500 --> 15:08.270
Your Queen orders you to stay
there like good subjects.

15:08.270 --> 15:10.530
Let us go, Houx-sama.

15:10.530 --> 15:11.930
Yes, Your Majesty.

15:12.870 --> 15:15.140
Houx's at Waffle's beck and call...

15:15.140 --> 15:18.310
Gotta say... For a defective
item, it sure works great.

15:18.310 --> 15:20.380
This is no time to act impressed!

15:20.380 --> 15:21.950
We've gotta follow them!

15:37.500 --> 15:38.530
Houx-sama.

15:38.530 --> 15:39.200
Yes?

15:40.360 --> 15:41.930
Will you tell me...

15:41.930 --> 15:44.570
what you think... of me?

15:44.570 --> 15:46.740
I respect you from
the bottom of my heart.

15:47.240 --> 15:48.370
You respect me?

15:48.370 --> 15:49.810
Yes, your Majesty.

15:50.270 --> 15:51.940
No! Look up, look at me.

15:52.480 --> 15:53.120
Yes.

15:55.680 --> 16:00.350
So, will you tell me...
tell me that...

16:00.350 --> 16:01.810
you love me?

16:02.250 --> 16:05.160
Yes, I love you, Your Majesty.

16:07.160 --> 16:09.030
O-One more time...

16:09.030 --> 16:11.560
Yes, I love you, Your Majesty.

16:13.500 --> 16:14.560
It's strange.

16:15.230 --> 16:19.420
They're the words I've always, always
wanted to hear from Houx-sama.

16:20.140 --> 16:23.760
I thought I'd faint dead away
when I heard them.

16:23.760 --> 16:25.240
But why?

16:25.240 --> 16:28.780
My heart didn't beat any faster, and I'm not even one bit happy about it.

16:29.510 --> 16:31.010
Why?

16:36.150 --> 16:36.970
This is wrong!

16:37.460 --> 16:40.360
You aren't the Houx-sama I love!

16:40.360 --> 16:42.730
I don't care how entranced you are,

16:42.730 --> 16:45.230
I don't want you to be like this!

16:46.530 --> 16:48.770
I don't wanna wear
this tiara anymore!

16:48.770 --> 16:49.600
Great!

16:49.600 --> 16:50.860
That's right, take it off!

16:51.670 --> 16:54.370
Eh? It won't come off!

16:55.470 --> 16:56.320
What was that?

16:57.320 --> 16:59.140
Why? Why?

16:59.140 --> 17:01.380
Why can't I take it off??

17:09.120 --> 17:10.390
Waffle-sama!

17:10.990 --> 17:11.920
What's going on?

17:20.000 --> 17:21.260
Waffle-sama!

17:24.540 --> 17:25.640
What do we do?

17:25.640 --> 17:27.810
The tiara's going out of control.

17:27.810 --> 17:29.070
Out of... control?

17:29.810 --> 17:31.880
This tends to happen
with defective goods.

17:31.880 --> 17:33.810
The tiara is taking on
a will of its own...

17:33.810 --> 17:36.310
and preventing Waffle
from removing it.

17:40.280 --> 17:43.330
This is scary! Somebody help me!

17:43.590 --> 17:46.290
Waffle, I'm coming
to save you right now!

17:57.970 --> 17:59.070
Yikes!

17:59.070 --> 18:01.440
We can't get anywhere near it.

18:02.140 --> 18:03.670
Unforgivable.

18:05.210 --> 18:06.310
Nana?

18:08.780 --> 18:10.850
I can never forgive you.

18:17.920 --> 18:18.820
Nana?

18:22.830 --> 18:24.390
Waffle-sama!!

18:24.960 --> 18:26.160
Nana!

18:36.040 --> 18:36.940
Amazing...

18:53.810 --> 18:55.060
Nana!

18:57.360 --> 18:59.030
Waffle-sama.

19:00.000 --> 19:01.620
Nana!!

19:01.970 --> 19:03.630
Are you all right?

19:03.630 --> 19:06.500
Chocolat, do your Fleur Spirale.

19:06.500 --> 19:07.620
Allright.

19:07.970 --> 19:10.370
Use some calm and pacifying flower...

19:10.370 --> 19:12.140
and take that tiara down!

19:12.140 --> 19:13.380
Got it.

19:13.710 --> 19:15.010
Sugar Sugar Rune!

19:15.010 --> 19:16.710
Choco Rune!

19:26.890 --> 19:27.490
Wand!

19:39.400 --> 19:40.270
All right then!

19:42.070 --> 19:44.060
Fleur Spirale!

20:04.700 --> 20:05.760
Success!

20:08.300 --> 20:09.310
It disappeared.

20:09.310 --> 20:11.570
Yipee, hurray!

20:15.770 --> 20:17.040
Waffle-sama!

20:19.740 --> 20:21.080
Waffle-sama!

20:26.950 --> 20:30.290
Waffle-sama, are you unhurt?

20:32.120 --> 20:34.020
Na... Nana,

20:36.090 --> 20:38.100
I was so frightened!

20:38.100 --> 20:40.060
Waffle-sama...

20:40.060 --> 20:43.130
That you are safe and sound
is the most important thing.

20:43.130 --> 20:47.200
Nana, I'm sorry for saying so
many mean things to you.

20:47.200 --> 20:49.170
What are you talking about?

20:49.170 --> 20:52.080
This is all my fault.

20:53.980 --> 20:54.980
Nana...

20:56.910 --> 20:59.440
Waffle-sama.

21:00.750 --> 21:02.490
Case closed!

21:02.490 --> 21:04.020
It's all good if it's over.

21:04.020 --> 21:07.490
And luckily, I was able to
dispose of the defective item.

21:07.490 --> 21:11.260
Still, who knew Nana could pull
off those heroic stunts?

21:11.260 --> 21:16.770
She was scared, but that just proves
how much she cares about Waffle.

21:16.770 --> 21:17.500
Yeah.

21:18.300 --> 21:20.210
Huh? What happened to me?

21:20.970 --> 21:22.340
Mochizuki-sensei...

21:22.340 --> 21:24.240
What are you all doing?

21:25.610 --> 21:27.640
Ah? Principal?!

21:29.210 --> 21:32.880
Ahem... We are grateful for the
hospitality you've shown us.

21:32.880 --> 21:34.850
We cannot thank you enough.

21:34.850 --> 21:36.320
It was nothing special...

21:36.320 --> 21:39.320
Well, we didn't do all that much.

21:39.920 --> 21:42.530
I guess I really do need Nana.

21:43.230 --> 21:44.730
Waffle-sama...

21:46.460 --> 21:47.700
That's so nice.

21:47.700 --> 21:49.800
Annnd... I need Houx-sama, too!

21:50.330 --> 21:51.580
Houx-sama...

21:53.340 --> 21:54.410
Houx-sama!

21:54.410 --> 21:54.870
What is it?

21:54.870 --> 21:56.410
Wait for me!

21:58.180 --> 21:59.540
That's so mean!

21:59.540 --> 22:01.570
Now that's our Waffle-sama!

22:03.680 --> 22:05.940
Jeez, give it a rest!

22:06.280 --> 22:08.110
Houx-sama!

22:09.120 --> 22:10.750
SAVE ME!!

22:10.750 --> 22:12.890
Houx-sama, I love you!

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:46.100 --> 23:48.770
Gramps suddenly shows up for a visit. Again.

23:48.770 --> 23:53.460
He's all gung-ho about taking everyone on a vacation to a tropical resort.

23:53.460 --> 23:57.210
But for me, putting up with him is no vacation whatsoever.

23:57.210 --> 24:01.300
Eh? Waffle, you and Nana are annoyed with Gramps too?

24:01.300 --> 24:04.370
All right, let's combine our forces and tell him off!

24:05.190 --> 24:07.240
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.240 --> 24:10.680
Stop Gramps!
Nana's (Secret) Grand Plan.

24:10.680 --> 24:13.060
This time it's your butt on the whupping block, Gramps!

24:13.060 --> 24:14.060
Thanks!
